# Assets and benchmark artefacts

When changing `content/assets/**`:

1. Keep benchmark scripts, data, diagrams, and generated files coherent.
2. Treat `content/assets/generated/benchmark_macros.tex` as a generated contract consumed by manuscript/slides.
3. If benchmark logic changes, verify dependent scripts under `content/assets/scripts/` still produce compatible outputs.
4. Avoid deleting or renaming shared assets referenced by `content/*.tex` or `apresentacoes/main.tex` without updating those references.
